The JavaScript part of the script handles both reading a file and hashing a password based on user input flags. It uses the `fetch` API to send a POST request to the PHP script with the appropriate parameters, and then processes the response from the PHP script using JSON parsing.

This script takes into account potential issues such as file access permissions, performance constraints, dependency management, and configuration flexibility. It also provides informative error messages and includes appropriate comments for clarity.']

