The function processes each scanline of the JPEG image using `jpeg_read_scanlines`, adding a new page to the PDF document for each scanline. It then draws an image on the current page using `pdf_draw_image` and saves the PDF document using `pdf_save_document`. The function repeats this process until all JPEG files have been processed, and then closes the configuration file using `fclose`.

