The `ValueGenerator` class is designed to be easily extensible, allowing for future integration with additional value types or data sources. It can handle a wide range of applications, from high-frequency trading systems to simple simulation tools, by balancing between ease of use and complexity.

The class provides options for logging and debugging, including the ability to enable detailed logs during development and disable them in production environments. This allows developers to monitor the behavior of the class and troubleshoot potential issues without affecting performance in production.']

