The function `insert_pdu` inserts a new PDU into the list at the appropriate position based on the `rx_ue_information_tag` field of the PDU. The function also handles potential external data source failures by retrying the operation.

The function `delete_pdu` deletes a PDU from the list and frees its memory. The function also handles potential external data source failures by retrying the operation.

